    "⚠️ Activa Apple Intelligence en Ajustes > Apple Intelligence y Siri para usar el asistente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ Turn on Apple Intelligence in Settings > Apple Intelligence & Siri to use the assistant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ El asistente no está disponible ahora mismo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ The assistant isn't available right now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ El modelo de Apple Intelligence se está descargando. Vuelve a intentarlo en unos minutos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ The Apple Intelligence model is downloading. Try again in a few minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ El modelo está ocupado ahora mismo. Espera unos segundos y pulsa «Reintentar»." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ The model is busy right now. Wait a few seconds and tap “Retry”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ Ese idioma no está disponible en el modelo del dispositivo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ That language isn't available in the on-device model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ Este dispositivo no es compatible con Apple Intelligence, que es lo que usa el asistente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ This device doesn't support Apple Intelligence, which the assistant uses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ La conversación es demasiado larga para recordarla entera. Pulsa «Reintentar»: seguiré sin el principio de la charla." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⚠️ The conversation is too long to remember in full. Tap “Retry”: I'll continue without the start of the chat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
