    "ASRock agrupa 92-97 como problema de gráfica o iGPU en algunas plataformas." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock groups 92-97 as a graphics card or iGPU problem on some platforms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock asocia este código a memoria, tarjeta gráfica u otros dispositivos conectados." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock links this code to memory, the graphics card or other connected devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock asocia este rango, salvo excepciones indicadas por su manual, a incidencias de memoria." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock links this range, except where its manual says otherwise, to memory issues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock documenta D4-D5 como error de asignación de recursos PCI." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock documents D4-D5 as a PCI resource assignment error."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock indica expresamente que la memoria no puede detectarse." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock explicitly states that the memory can't be detected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock recomienda comprobar la instalación del procesador y restaurar la configuración CMOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock recommends checking the processor installation and restoring the CMOS settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock recomienda reinstalar dispositivos IDE y SATA." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ASRock recommends reinstalling IDE and SATA devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ASRock recomienda reinstalar la VGA y probar otra ranura si persiste." : {
