        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screw in the motherboard without bending the PCB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Atornille el ventilador respetando la dirección de flujo indicada por las flechas de su marco. Conecte un ventilador PWM o DC a SYS_FAN, CHA_FAN o a un hub. No conecte demasiados ventiladores a un solo cabezal sin conocer su límite de corriente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screw in the fan following the airflow direction shown by the arrows on its frame. Connect a PWM or DC fan to SYS_FAN, CHA_FAN or a hub. Don't connect too many fans to one header without knowing its current limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
