    "Coloca primero la RAM en A2. Si instalas dos módulos, usa A2 y B2. Confirma las marcas impresas en tu placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put the RAM in A2 first. If you're installing two modules, use A2 and B2. Check the markings printed on your motherboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colocar separadores de placa base en la caja" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fit the motherboard standoffs in the case"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coloque separadores únicamente donde la placa tenga agujeros de montaje. No deje separadores extra bajo zonas sin agujero, ya que pueden provocar un cortocircuito. Después coloque la placa y atorníllela sin exceso de fuerza." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fit standoffs only where the motherboard has mounting holes. Don't leave extra standoffs under areas without a hole, as they can cause a short circuit. Then place the motherboard and screw it in without too much force."
          }
        }
      }
    },
