            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the drives and boot order"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comprueba el orden de los pitidos o elige otra BIOS. Cada fabricante puede usar códigos propios: consulta el manual de tu placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the order of the beeps or choose another BIOS. Each manufacturer may use its own codes: check your motherboard manual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comprueba la compatibilidad de la RAM con la placa y CPU." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the RAM is compatible with the motherboard and CPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comprueba que el conector ATX de 24 pines y el EPS de 8 pines están bien conectados." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the 24-pin ATX and 8-pin EPS connectors are properly plugged in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comprueba que el conector EPS de 8 pines (CPU) está conectado." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the 8-pin EPS (CPU) connector is plugged in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comprueba que la BIOS de la placa es compatible con tu procesador (puede necesitar actualización)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the motherboard BIOS supports your processor (it may need an update)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comprueba que la gráfica está bien encajada en la ranura PCIe x16 y atornillada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the graphics card is fully seated in the PCIe x16 slot and screwed in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compruebe que el formato de la placa —ATX, microATX o Mini-ITX— es compatible con la caja. Coloque separadores solo donde coincidan con sus agujeros. Instale el protector I/O si no está integrado, baje la placa sin arrastrarla y fíjela con tornillos sin apretar en exceso." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the motherboard form factor —ATX, microATX or Mini-ITX— is compatible with the case. Fit standoffs only where they line up with its holes. Install the I/O shield if it isn't built in, lower the board without dragging it and secure it with screws without overtightening."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compruebe que la CPU y el socket de la placa son compatibles y que la BIOS la admite. Sujétela por los bordes, alinee el triángulo o las muescas con la marca del socket y déjela asentarse sin hacer fuerza. Cierre el mecanismo de retención. Aplique pasta térmica si el disipador no la trae y monte una refrigeración compatible." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that the CPU and the motherboard socket are compatible and that the BIOS supports it. Hold it by the edges, line up the triangle or notches with the socket mark and let it settle without force. Close the retention mechanism. Apply thermal paste if the cooler doesn't come with it and fit a compatible cooler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compruebe que la potencia y conectores cubren todos los componentes. Colóquela en la caja con el ventilador hacia el filtro inferior si hay ventilación bajo la caja; si no, siga el manual del chasis. Fíjela con cuatro tornillos y conecte primero ATX de 24 pines, EPS de CPU, GPU y almacenamiento." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check that its wattage and connectors cover all the components. Mount it in the case with the fan facing the bottom filter if there's ventilation underneath; otherwise, follow the case manual. Secure it with four screws and connect the 24-pin ATX, CPU EPS, GPU and storage first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compuesto que mejora la transferencia de calor entre el procesador y la base del disipador. Es necesaria salvo que el disipador incluya pasta preaplicada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compound that improves heat transfer between the processor and the cooler base. It's needed unless the cooler has pre-applied paste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con el equipo apagado, limpie los restos antiguos con alcohol isopropílico y una toallita sin pelusa. Aplique una gota centrada, aproximadamente del tamaño de un guisante. Coloque el disipador recto y apriete su anclaje; la presión repartirá la pasta. No la extienda con el dedo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With the PC off, clean off old paste with isopropyl alcohol and a lint-free wipe. Apply a centred drop about the size of a pea. Place the cooler straight down and tighten its mount; the pressure will spread the paste. Don't spread it with your finger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Concentrador que permite alimentar y controlar varios ventiladores desde un solo cabezal de la placa o mediante alimentación SATA." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hub that lets you power and control several fans from a single motherboard header or from SATA power."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecta aquí el cable SATA de datos que sale de tu SSD o HDD de 2.5/3.5 pulgadas." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the SATA data cable from your 2.5/3.5-inch SSD or HDD here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecta el monitor a la gráfica, no a la placa base." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the monitor to the graphics card, not to the motherboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecta los cables de alimentación PCIe de la fuente a la gráfica." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the PSU's PCIe power cables to the graphics card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar alimentación PCIe o 12VHPWR a GPU" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect PCIe or 12VHPWR power to the GPU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar alimentación SATA de la fuente" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect SATA power from the PSU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar cable ATX de 24 pines" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the 24-pin ATX cable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar cable CPU_FAN al disipador" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the CPU_FAN cable to the cooler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar cable EPS CPU de 8 pines" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the 8-pin EPS CPU cable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar cable SATA de datos" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the SATA data cable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar el monitor a la GPU dedicada" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the monitor to the dedicated GPU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar monitor a la GPU dedicada" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the monitor to the dedicated GPU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar pantalla, teclado y cable de corriente" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the display, keyboard and power cable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar Power SW y LEDs del panel frontal" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the front panel Power SW and LEDs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar Reset SW del panel frontal" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the front panel Reset SW"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar solo teclado por cable" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect only a wired keyboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar teclado USB por cable" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect a wired USB keyboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar USB frontal y audio HD frontal" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect front USB and front HD audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conectar ventiladores extra de la caja a SYS_FAN" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect extra case fans to SYS_FAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte auriculares o altavoces analógicos al puerto de salida de audio verde o al conector frontal. Para dispositivos USB o Bluetooth, selecciónelos como salida de sonido desde los ajustes del sistema." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect analogue headphones or speakers to the green audio output port or the front jack. For USB or Bluetooth devices, select them as the sound output in the system settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte el cable de vídeo a la GPU dedicada si existe y después al monitor. Conecte también la alimentación del monitor y seleccione la entrada correcta desde su menú. Configure resolución y frecuencia de actualización desde el sistema operativo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the video cable to the dedicated GPU if there is one and then to the monitor. Also connect the monitor's power and select the right input from its menu. Set the resolution and refresh rate in the operating system."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte el cable o receptor USB a un puerto disponible. Si usa Bluetooth, active el modo de emparejamiento y selecciónelo desde el sistema operativo. Ajuste sensibilidad y botones desde el software del fabricante si lo necesita." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plug the cable or USB receiver into a free port. If it uses Bluetooth, turn on pairing mode and select it in the operating system. Adjust sensitivity and buttons in the manufacturer's software if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte el cable USB o receptor inalámbrico a un puerto disponible. Para Bluetooth, active el modo de emparejamiento y selecciónelo desde los ajustes del sistema." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plug the USB cable or wireless receiver into a free port. For Bluetooth, turn on pairing mode and select it in the system settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte el extremo IEC a la fuente y el enchufe a una toma con tierra. Mantenga el interruptor trasero de la PSU apagado durante el montaje. Enciéndalo únicamente después de revisar todas las conexiones internas." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the IEC end to the PSU and the plug to an earthed socket. Keep the PSU's rear switch off while building. Only turn it on after checking all the internal connections."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte HDD LED+ y HDD LED- a los pines correspondientes del F_PANEL respetando la polaridad. Si no se ilumina, apague el sistema e invierta el conector." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect HDD LED+ and HDD LED- to the matching F_PANEL pins, respecting polarity. If it doesn't light up, turn off the system and flip the connector."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte los terminales PLED+ y PLED- a los pines de Power LED del F_PANEL respetando la polaridad. Si no se ilumina tras encender el equipo, apáguelo e invierta el conector." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect the PLED+ and PLED- terminals to the Power LED pins on the F_PANEL, respecting polarity. If it doesn't light up after powering on, turn the PC off and flip the connector."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conecte un extremo a un puerto SATA de la placa y el otro a la unidad. La forma de L evita una orientación incorrecta. No confunda este cable fino con el conector ancho de alimentación SATA." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect one end to a SATA port on the motherboard and the other to the drive. The L shape prevents connecting it the wrong way round. Don't confuse this thin cable with the wide SATA power connector."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conéctelo al par de pines PWR_SW o POWER SW del cabezal F_PANEL. La polaridad no importa. Consulte el esquema de su placa base para identificar la posición exacta." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect it to the PWR_SW or POWER SW pair of pins on the F_PANEL header. Polarity doesn't matter. Check your motherboard diagram for the exact position."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conéctelo al par de pines RESET SW o RST_SW del F_PANEL. La polaridad no importa. Si su caja no incluye botón de reinicio, este cable no se utiliza." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect it to the RESET SW or RST_SW pair of pins on the F_PANEL. Polarity doesn't matter. If your case has no reset button, this cable isn't used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector 12VHPWR" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12VHPWR connector"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector ARGB 5V" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5V ARGB header"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector ATX 24p" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "24-pin ATX connector"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector de 16 pines de las gráficas modernas. Debe entrar hasta el fondo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "16-pin connector on modern graphics cards. It must be pushed all the way in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector de alimentación de alta potencia para GPUs modernas, también evolucionado como 12V-2x6. Puede sustituir varios conectores PCIe de ocho pines." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "High-power connector for modern GPUs, also updated as 12V-2x6. It can replace several 8-pin PCIe connectors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector de alimentación EPS12V de 8 pines o 4+4 integrado en la placa base. Alimenta el circuito de regulación de voltaje de la CPU." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8-pin or 4+4-pin EPS12V power connector built into the motherboard. It powers the CPU's voltage regulation circuit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector de alimentación SATA de 15 pines procedente de la fuente. Aporta energía a SSD SATA, HDD, hubs de ventiladores y otros accesorios compatibles." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "15-pin SATA power connector from the PSU. It powers SATA SSDs, HDDs, fan hubs and other compatible accessories."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector EPS 8p" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8-pin EPS connector"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector FAN" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "FAN header"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector HD Audio" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HD Audio header"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector M.2 integrado en la placa base para SSD compactos. Dependiendo de la placa y la ranura, puede admitir unidades NVMe, SATA o ambas." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "M.2 connector built into the motherboard for compact SSDs. Depending on the board and slot, it may support NVMe drives, SATA drives or both."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector para el USB-C del frontal de la caja." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connector for the case's front USB-C port."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector PCIe x1" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PCIe x1 connector"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector PCIe x16" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PCIe x16 connector"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector periférico Molex de cuatro pines presente en fuentes y accesorios antiguos o en algunos hubs y controladores RGB." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Four-pin Molex peripheral connector found on older PSUs and accessories, and on some fan hubs and RGB controllers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector principal de alimentación de 24 pines integrado en la placa base. Recibe energía de la fuente para la placa, memoria, controladores y ranuras." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Main 24-pin power connector built into the motherboard. It receives power from the PSU for the board, memory, controllers and slots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector RGB 12V" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12V RGB header"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conector SYS FAN" : {
