            "value" : "E.g. 1440p Gaming PC"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El «cerebro» del SSD: gestiona dónde se guarda cada dato." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The SSD's “brain”: it manages where each piece of data is stored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El 55 suele asociarse específicamente a memoria no detectada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "55 is usually linked specifically to undetected memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El cabezal no se instala: conecte aquí el cable del ventilador del disipador. Alinee la guía plástica del conector y presiónelo suavemente. No deje CPU_FAN vacío salvo que el manual de la placa o de la refrigeración indique otra configuración." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect the cooler fan cable here. Line up the connector's plastic guide and press gently. Don't leave CPU_FAN empty unless the motherboard or cooler manual says otherwise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El cabezal no se instala: conecte aquí un ventilador de caja o el cable de señal de un hub. Para varios ventiladores, use un repartidor o hub alimentado y respete el límite de corriente indicado por el fabricante de la placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect a case fan or a hub's signal cable here. For several fans, use a splitter or powered hub and respect the current limit given by the motherboard manufacturer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El checklist de montaje seguirá el progreso de esta build" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The assembly checklist will follow this build's progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El chipset entra en la fase DXE de inicialización de dispositivos y recursos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chipset enters the DXE stage of device and resource initialisation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El chipset es un controlador integrado en la placa base que gestiona puertos USB, SATA, líneas PCIe adicionales y otras funciones de entrada y salida." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chipset is a controller built into the motherboard that manages USB ports, SATA, extra PCIe lanes and other input/output functions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El chipset no se instala ni se conecta por separado. Funciona automáticamente al conectar dispositivos compatibles a la placa. Consulte el manual: algunas ranuras M.2 pueden compartir líneas con puertos SATA o PCIe y desactivar determinadas conexiones." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The chipset isn't installed or connected separately. It works automatically when you connect compatible devices to the motherboard. Check the manual: some M.2 slots may share lanes with SATA or PCIe ports and disable certain connections."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código %@ no está incluido en la base local. Consulta el manual específico de la placa base o usa el asistente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Code %@ isn't in the local database. Check your motherboard's own manual or use the assistant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El código puede involucrar dispositivos de expansión además de vídeo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The code may involve expansion devices as well as video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El componente se quitará de este build." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The component will be removed from this build."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El conector ya está integrado en la placa, normalmente cerca de la esquina superior izquierda. Conecte aquí el cable marcado CPU o EPS de la fuente; no use un cable PCI-E de GPU aunque parezca similar. Alinee las formas y el clip antes de presionar." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connector is already built into the motherboard, usually near the top-left corner. Connect the PSU cable marked CPU or EPS here; don't use a GPU PCI-E cable even if it looks similar. Line up the shapes and the clip before pressing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El conector ya está integrado en la placa. Conecte aquí el cable ATX de 24 pines de la fuente. Alinee la pestaña del cable con el cierre del conector y presione uniformemente hasta que el clip quede bloqueado. No lo confunda con el cable EPS de CPU." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The connector is already built into the motherboard. Connect the PSU's 24-pin ATX cable here. Line up the cable tab with the connector latch and press evenly until the clip locks. Don't confuse it with the CPU EPS cable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El detalle exacto de estos códigos depende de la plataforma." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exact detail of these codes depends on the platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El fabricante puede asignar significados específicos a cada valor." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The manufacturer may give specific meanings to each value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware continúa configurando servicios de CPU durante la fase DXE." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware keeps configuring CPU services during the DXE stage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware continúa tareas internas de inicialización y entrenamiento de memoria." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware is continuing internal memory initialisation and training tasks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware detectó un error durante el autotest interno o la inicialización de caché del procesador." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware found an error during the processor's internal self-test or cache initialisation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware detectó un problema durante una actualización o proceso de recuperación de BIOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware found a problem during a BIOS update or recovery process."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware espera una acción del usuario antes de continuar, normalmente dentro de BIOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware is waiting for user action before continuing, usually inside the BIOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware está aplicando la configuración de la RAM antes de continuar con el POST." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware is applying the RAM configuration before continuing POST."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware está asignando recursos PCIe o inicializando la tarjeta gráfica." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware is assigning PCIe resources or initialising the graphics card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware está borrando, aplicando o restaurando ajustes guardados de BIOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware is erasing, applying or restoring saved BIOS settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware está buscando unidades SATA, M.2 o dispositivos de arranque." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware is looking for SATA or M.2 drives or boot devices."
          }
