    },
    "El firmware ha detectado un error interno durante la inicialización del procesador." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware found an internal error while initialising the processor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware ha terminado la inicialización principal y está listo para continuar hacia el sistema operativo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware has finished the main initialisation and is ready to continue to the operating system."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no detecta correctamente el disco o unidad configurada para arrancar." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't properly detect the disk or drive set up to boot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no detecta una tarjeta gráfica o la salida integrada de CPU." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't detect a graphics card or the CPU's integrated output."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no encuentra una GPU o salida gráfica funcional." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't find a working GPU or graphics output."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no puede cargar la entrada de arranque configurada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't load the configured boot entry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no puede completar la detección o el acceso al dispositivo de arranque." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't finish detecting or accessing the boot device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no puede completar una fase crítica de CPU, chipset o controladores principales." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't finish a critical CPU, chipset or main controller stage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no puede detectar o configurar la memoria RAM correctamente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't detect or configure the RAM properly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no puede encontrar o configurar la RAM instalada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't find or configure the installed RAM."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware no puede encontrar un teclado u otro dispositivo de entrada durante el POST." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware can't find a keyboard or other input device during POST."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El firmware pasa desde la fase temprana de POST a la fase DXE, donde inicializa dispositivos y servicios UEFI." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The firmware moves from the early POST stage to the DXE stage, where it initialises devices and UEFI services."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El hardware base ha superado las comprobaciones principales, pero no se detecta un sistema operativo o una unidad válida configurada para iniciar el equipo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The core hardware has passed the main checks, but no operating system or valid drive set up to start the computer was found."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El nombre te ayuda a distinguir esta configuración. La etiqueta define su propósito principal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The name helps you tell this configuration apart. The tag sets its main purpose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El procesador no encaja en la placa" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The CPU doesn't fit the motherboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El procesador usa %@ y la placa %@. Hace falta cambiar uno de los dos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The CPU uses %@ and the motherboard %@. One of them needs to be changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El proceso de arranque ha terminado y el sistema operativo ha tomado el control." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The boot process has finished and the operating system has taken over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El puerto SATA no se instala: conecte aquí un extremo del cable de datos SATA. Alinee la muesca en forma de L sin forzar y conecte el otro extremo a la unidad. La unidad necesita además un cable de alimentación SATA desde la fuente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The SATA port isn't installed: connect one end of the SATA data cable here. Line up the L-shaped notch without forcing it and connect the other end to the drive. The drive also needs a SATA power cable from the PSU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El puerto ya está integrado. Conecte el cable con la cara correcta hacia arriba, sin forzar: USB-A solo entra en una posición. Use los puertos USB 3.x para discos externos y los USB 2.0 para teclado y ratón." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The port is already built in. Plug in the cable the right way up without forcing it: USB-A only goes in one way. Use USB 3.x ports for external drives and USB 2.0 ports for the keyboard and mouse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El puerto ya está integrado. Conecte el cable DisplayPort a la tarjeta gráfica y al monitor. Algunos conectores incluyen pestaña de bloqueo; presiónela antes de retirar el cable. Configure después resolución y frecuencia de actualización desde el sistema operativo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The port is already built in. Connect the DisplayPort cable to the graphics card and the monitor. Some connectors have a locking tab; press it before removing the cable. Then set the resolution and refresh rate in the operating system."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El puerto ya está integrado. Conecte el cable HDMI a la GPU dedicada si el PC tiene una. Use el puerto de la placa base únicamente si utiliza gráficos integrados. Seleccione después la entrada HDMI correcta en el monitor." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The port is already built in. Connect the HDMI cable to the dedicated GPU if the PC has one. Only use the motherboard port if you're using integrated graphics. Then select the right HDMI input on the monitor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El puerto ya está integrado. Conecte un cable Ethernet RJ45 hasta que la pestaña haga clic y conecte el otro extremo al router o switch. Los LED del puerto suelen indicar enlace y actividad." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The port is already built in. Plug in an RJ45 Ethernet cable until the tab clicks and connect the other end to the router or switch. The port LEDs usually show link and activity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El puerto ya está integrado. El conector entra en cualquier orientación. Consulte el manual de la placa para saber si ese puerto admite vídeo o carga rápida, ya que no todos los USB-C tienen las mismas funciones." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The port is already built in. The connector goes in either way. Check the motherboard manual to see whether that port supports video or fast charging, since not all USB-C ports have the same features."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El significado exacto de A3 puede variar por fabricante." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exact meaning of A3 may vary by manufacturer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El significado exacto puede cambiar según la implementación del fabricante." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exact meaning may change depending on the manufacturer's implementation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El sistema espera interacción del usuario o está preparado para entrar en la configuración." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system is waiting for user input or is ready to enter setup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El sistema está preparado para entrar o ya ha entrado en la interfaz de configuración BIOS/UEFI." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system is ready to enter, or has already entered, the BIOS/UEFI setup interface."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El sistema está restaurando el estado después de salir de suspensión." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system is restoring its state after waking from sleep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El sistema ha llegado a la interfaz de configuración BIOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system has reached the BIOS setup interface."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El sistema ha llegado a la interfaz de configuración del firmware." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The system has reached the firmware setup interface."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El socket no se instala ni se conecta: forma parte de la placa base. Levante la palanca, alinee el triángulo dorado de la CPU con la marca del socket y déjela caer sin fuerza. Baje la palanca para fijarla. En AM4, proteja los pines de la CPU; en AM5, no toque los contactos del socket." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The socket isn't installed or connected: it's part of the motherboard. Lift the lever, line up the gold triangle on the CPU with the mark on the socket and let it drop in without force. Lower the lever to lock it. On AM4, protect the CPU pins; on AM5, don't touch the socket contacts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El socket no se instala ni se conecta: ya forma parte de la placa base. Para colocar una CPU compatible, abra la palanca y la tapa de retención, alinee el triángulo de la CPU con la marca del socket y déjela asentarse sin presionar. Cierre la tapa y baje la palanca. No toque ni doble los contactos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The socket isn't installed or connected: it's already part of the motherboard. To fit a compatible CPU, open the lever and retention plate, line up the triangle on the CPU with the mark on the socket and let it settle without pressing. Close the plate and lower the lever. Don't touch or bend the contacts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El socket no se instala: forma parte de la placa base. Levante la palanca, alinee el triángulo de la CPU con la marca del socket y déjela caer sin presionar. Baje la palanca para fijarla. No toque ni doble los pines o contactos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The socket isn't installed: it's part of the motherboard. Lift the lever, line up the triangle on the CPU with the mark on the socket and let it drop in without pressing. Lower the lever to secure it. Don't touch or bend the pins or contacts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El tratamiento exacto depende de la plataforma de la placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exact handling depends on the motherboard's platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El VRM no se instala ni se conecta por separado. Para que funcione, conecte el cable EPS o CPU de la fuente al conector de alimentación de CPU de la placa. Mantenga despejada esta zona y compruebe que el disipador de CPU no presiona sus disipadores metálicos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The VRM isn't installed or connected separately. For it to work, connect the EPS or CPU cable from the PSU to the motherboard's CPU power connector. Keep this area clear and check that the CPU cooler doesn't press on its metal heatsinks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El VRM, o módulo regulador de voltaje, está integrado en la placa base y transforma la energía de la fuente en voltajes estables para la CPU." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The VRM, or voltage regulator module, is built into the motherboard and converts power from the PSU into stable voltages for the CPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elige una build" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
