    },
    "Empieza una conversación con el asistente\ny volverá a aparecer guardada aquí." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start a conversation with the assistant\nand it'll be saved here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En algunas placas el 00 también puede aparecer tras un fallo de POST; confirma el manual del modelo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On some motherboards 00 can also appear after a POST failure; check your model's manual."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En algunas placas este código se muestra brevemente durante un arranque normal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On some motherboards this code appears briefly during a normal boot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En DDR5 el entrenamiento de memoria puede durar más de lo esperado." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With DDR5, memory training may take longer than expected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En el dispositivo" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En equipos domésticos puede ser un estado temporal sin problema." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On home computers it may be a harmless temporary state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En Gigabyte el comportamiento exacto puede variar por BIOS y plataforma." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On Gigabyte the exact behaviour may vary by BIOS and platform."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En Intel 12.ª-14.ª generación hay placas DDR4 y DDR5. Comprueba que la tuya sea %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intel 12th-14th gen has both DDR4 and DDR5 motherboards. Check that yours is %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En la mayoría de equipos modernos un pitido corto significa que todo ha ido bien. Si además no hay imagen, la BIOS AMI antigua lo usa para un fallo de refresco de la memoria." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On most modern computers, one short beep means everything went fine. If there's also no picture, old AMI BIOSes use it for a memory refresh failure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En proceso" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En Proceso" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En un PC doméstico puede ser simplemente un estado temporal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On a home PC it may simply be a temporary state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encender PC y comprobar POST o BIOS" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Power on the PC and check POST or BIOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encendida" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enciende la fuente. «I» es encendido y «O» apagado: apágala antes de tocar nada dentro." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns the PSU on. “I” is on and “O” is off: switch it off before touching anything inside."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encuentra el fallo de arranque" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find the startup failure"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encuentra información sobre sockets, conectores, RAM,\nalmacenamiento, refrigeración y mucho más." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find information about sockets, connectors, RAM,\nstorage, cooling and much more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Energía" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Power"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enfoca a la vez la placa base y el componente para activar la guía visual." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Frame the motherboard and the component together to turn on the visual guide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enfría la fuente. Si la caja tiene filtro abajo, monta la fuente con el ventilador hacia abajo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cools the PSU. If the case has a bottom filter, mount the PSU with the fan facing down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enfría la GPU. Muchos se paran en reposo: es normal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cools the GPU. Many stop at idle: that's normal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enfrían la GPU. Muchos se paran en reposo: es normal." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They cool the GPU. Many stop at idle: that's normal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enrosque las antenas en los conectores traseros dorados sin forzar. Colóquelas separadas y, si usan una base con cable, sitúelas fuera de la caja para mejorar la recepción." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screw the antennas onto the gold rear connectors without forcing them. Space them apart and, if they use a base with a cable, place them outside the case for better reception."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entendido" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Got it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entra en BIOS y confirma que el SSD aparece detectado antes de intentar instalar o arrancar el sistema operativo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the BIOS and confirm the SSD is detected before trying to install or boot the operating system."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entra en la BIOS (Supr o F2 al arrancar), carga los valores por defecto y guarda." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the BIOS (Del or F2 at startup), load the default values and save."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entra en una ranura PCIe x1 (también vale una x16 libre)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Goes into a PCIe x1 slot (a free x16 slot also works)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entrada de micrófono" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Microphone input"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entran en la ranura de la placa. La muesca del borde impide ponerlo al revés o en una ranura de otro tipo (DDR4/DDR5)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They go into the motherboard slot. The notch on the edge stops it going in backwards or into the wrong type of slot (DDR4/DDR5)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entran inclinados en la ranura M.2 de la placa; luego se baja el SSD y se atornilla." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They go into the motherboard's M.2 slot at an angle; then the SSD is pressed down and screwed in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
