    "Instalar tarjeta gráfica dedicada GPU" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install a dedicated graphics card (GPU)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instale el backplate y anclajes compatibles con su socket. Aplique pasta térmica si no viene preaplicada. Coloque el disipador y apriete los tornillos alternando en cruz. Conecte el ventilador principal al cabezal CPU_FAN." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install the backplate and mounts compatible with your socket. Apply thermal paste if it isn't pre-applied. Place the cooler and tighten the screws in a cross pattern. Connect the main fan to the CPU_FAN header."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instale la CPU solo en una placa con socket Intel y BIOS compatibles. Sujétela por los bordes, alinee sus muescas y el triángulo con el socket, y déjela asentarse sin fuerza. Cierre el mecanismo de retención. Aplique pasta térmica solo si el disipador no la trae preaplicada y monte una refrigeración compatible." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install the CPU only on a motherboard with a compatible Intel socket and BIOS. Hold it by the edges, line up its notches and triangle with the socket and let it settle without force. Close the retention mechanism. Apply thermal paste only if the cooler doesn't have it pre-applied, and fit a compatible cooler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instale la CPU únicamente en una placa y socket AMD compatibles. Sujétela por los bordes, alinee el triángulo dorado con la marca del socket y déjela asentarse sin fuerza. Cierre la palanca. En AM4, no doble los pines de la CPU; en AM5, no toque los contactos del socket. Termine instalando un disipador compatible." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install the CPU only on a compatible AMD motherboard and socket. Hold it by the edges, line up the gold triangle with the socket mark and let it settle without force. Close the lever. On AM4, don't bend the CPU pins; on AM5, don't touch the socket contacts. Finish by installing a compatible cooler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instale módulos de la misma generación admitida por la placa base. Abra los seguros de la ranura, alinee la muesca y presione recto hasta que encajen. Para usar doble canal, coloque el kit en las ranuras indicadas por el manual, normalmente A2 y B2." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install modules of the same generation supported by the motherboard. Open the slot latches, line up the notch and press straight down until they click. For dual channel, fit the kit in the slots shown in the manual, usually A2 and B2."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instálela en una ranura PCIe compatible y fíjela al chasis. Conecte la fuente de vídeo a su entrada HDMI o SDI según el modelo. Instale el software y controladores recomendados por el fabricante." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install it in a compatible PCIe slot and secure it to the chassis. Connect the video source to its HDMI or SDI input depending on the model. Install the software and drivers recommended by the manufacturer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instálela en una ranura PCIe x1 libre y fíjela al chasis. Conecte las antenas a los conectores dorados del panel trasero. Instale después los controladores del fabricante o del chipset inalámbrico." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install it in a free PCIe x1 slot and secure it to the chassis. Connect the antennas to the gold connectors on the rear panel. Then install the drivers from the manufacturer or the wireless chipset."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instálela en una ranura PCIe x1 libre, fíjela a la caja e instale su controlador. Conecte altavoces, auriculares o micrófono en los puertos indicados por el fabricante." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install it in a free PCIe x1 slot, secure it to the case and install its driver. Connect speakers, headphones or a microphone to the ports indicated by the manufacturer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intercambiador de calor de la refrigeración líquida. Disipa el calor del líquido refrigerante hacia el aire exterior mediante ventiladores." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Liquid cooling heat exchanger. It releases the coolant's heat into the outside air using fans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intermedio" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intermediate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrumpir la recuperación puede dañar el firmware de la placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Interrupting the recovery can damage the motherboard's firmware."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interruptor" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introduce el código de dos caracteres que ves en la placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the two-character code you see on the motherboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introduce el código visible" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the code shown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introducir la contraseña correcta" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter the correct password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ir a la siguiente página" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go to the next page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kent Madsen" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kent Madsen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La BIOS ha detectado un error al comprobar la memoria RAM." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The BIOS found an error while checking the RAM."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La BIOS no contiene o no puede cargar el microcódigo necesario para el procesador instalado." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The BIOS doesn't contain or can't load the microcode needed for the installed processor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La BIOS o UEFI es el firmware de la placa base. Inicializa el hardware antes del sistema operativo y permite configurar memoria, ventiladores, almacenamiento y orden de arranque." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The BIOS or UEFI is the motherboard firmware. It initialises the hardware before the operating system and lets you configure memory, fans, storage and boot order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte aquí el bloque etiquetado HD AUDIO de la caja. Alinee el hueco con el pin ausente. Use HD AUDIO; no conecte AC'97 salvo que un hardware antiguo lo requiera." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect the case's block labelled HD AUDIO here. Line up the blocked hole with the missing pin. Use HD AUDIO; don't connect AC'97 unless old hardware requires it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte aquí el cable USB 2.0 interno del accesorio o de la caja. Alinee el hueco del conector con el pin ausente de la cabecera y no fuerce el cable." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect the accessory's or case's internal USB 2.0 cable here. Line up the connector's blocked hole with the header's missing pin and don't force the cable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte aquí el cable USB frontal ancho de la caja. Alinee la guía y presiónelo recto; evite doblar los pines. Es aconsejable conectarlo antes de cerrar el cableado trasero." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect the case's wide front USB cable here. Line up the key and press it straight in; avoid bending the pins. It's best to connect it before tidying the rear cabling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte aquí el cable USB-C frontal de la caja si ambos son compatibles. Inserte el conector siguiendo su guía sin torcerlo. Si la placa no dispone de esta cabecera, el USB-C frontal puede quedar sin uso o requerir una tarjeta adaptadora." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect the case's front USB-C cable here if both are compatible. Insert the connector following its key without twisting it. If the motherboard doesn't have this header, the front USB-C may go unused or need an adapter card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte aquí los cables finos que salen de la caja. Siga el diagrama exacto del manual de la placa. Power SW y Reset SW no tienen polaridad; Power LED y HDD LED sí la tienen. Si un LED no luce, apague el PC y gire su conector." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: connect the thin cables coming from the case here. Follow the exact diagram in the motherboard manual. Power SW and Reset SW have no polarity; Power LED and HDD LED do. If an LED doesn't light up, turn off the PC and flip its connector."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte únicamente accesorios ARGB de 5 V y tres pines. Alinee la flecha o marca de 5V del cable con el pin de 5V. Nunca conecte aquí un accesorio RGB de 12 V y cuatro pines." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: only connect 5 V three-pin ARGB accessories. Line up the arrow or 5V mark on the cable with the 5V pin. Never connect a 12 V four-pin RGB accessory here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cabecera no se instala: conecte únicamente accesorios RGB de 12 V y cuatro pines, alineando la marca de 12V. No conecte un accesorio ARGB de 5 V y tres pines: son eléctricamente incompatibles y puede dañarse la iluminación." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The header isn't installed: only connect 12 V four-pin RGB accessories, lining up the 12V mark. Don't connect a 5 V three-pin ARGB accessory: they're electrically incompatible and the lighting can be damaged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La caja o chasis aloja, protege y organiza los componentes. Determina compatibilidad de placa, longitud de GPU, altura de disipador y posiciones de radiador." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The case or chassis houses, protects and organises the components. It determines motherboard compatibility, GPU length, cooler height and radiator positions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La comprobación de la BIOS ha fallado; puede estar corrupta." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The BIOS checksum failed; it may be corrupted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La comprobación inicial (POST) ha terminado sin errores." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The power-on self-test (POST) finished without errors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La configuración supera el presupuesto objetivo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The configuration is over the target budget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La contraseña introducida para el firmware o el arranque no es válida." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The password entered for the firmware or boot isn't valid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La CPU instalada no cumple los requisitos de la placa o el firmware no puede usar su configuración actual." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The installed CPU doesn't meet the motherboard's requirements or the firmware can't use its current configuration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La CPU no responde correctamente." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The CPU isn't responding properly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La denominación es heredada; en plataformas modernas puede referirse a lógica integrada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The name is legacy; on modern platforms it may refer to integrated logic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La fuente de alimentación o PSU convierte la corriente alterna de la red en corriente continua estable para placa, CPU, GPU, almacenamiento y accesorios." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The power supply or PSU converts AC mains power into stable DC power for the motherboard, CPU, GPU, storage and accessories."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La fuente se queda corta" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PSU falls short"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La inicialización principal ha terminado y el firmware está listo para continuar con el proceso de arranque." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The main initialisation has finished and the firmware is ready to continue booting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La memoria convencional o extendida ha fallado la prueba." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conventional or extended memory failed the test."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La memoria de la BIOS está dañada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The BIOS memory is damaged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La memoria no es compatible" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The memory isn't compatible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La memoria no se detecta correctamente o no puede completar el entrenamiento." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The memory isn't detected properly or can't finish training."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La nomenclatura exacta cambia entre plataformas Intel y AMD." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The exact naming varies between Intel and AMD platforms."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa base no detecta una salida de vídeo válida. Puede ocurrir si la tarjeta gráfica no está bien insertada, no recibe alimentación o el monitor está conectado al puerto equivocado." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't find a valid video output. This can happen if the graphics card isn't fully inserted, isn't getting power or the monitor is connected to the wrong port."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa base no puede detectar o inicializar correctamente el procesador. Revisa la colocación de la CPU, el socket y la alimentación EPS de la placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't detect or initialise the processor properly. Check the CPU placement, the socket and the motherboard's EPS power."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa base o motherboard es el circuito principal del PC. Conecta CPU, RAM, almacenamiento, tarjetas de expansión, alimentación y puertos externos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is the PC's main circuit board. It connects the CPU, RAM, storage, expansion cards, power and external ports."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está configurando los recursos del chipset después de detectar CPU y memoria." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is configuring chipset resources after detecting the CPU and memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está configurando periféricos antiguos, USB o tarjetas de expansión." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is configuring legacy peripherals, USB or expansion cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está detectando teclado, ratón u otros dispositivos de entrada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is detecting the keyboard, mouse or other input devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está detectando y asignando recursos a GPU y otras tarjetas PCI Express." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is detecting and assigning resources to the GPU and other PCI Express cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está detectando y configurando módulos y canales de RAM." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is detecting and configuring RAM modules and channels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está inicializando el puente principal de PCI Express y los recursos de expansión." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is initialising the main PCI Express bridge and expansion resources."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está inicializando el puente sur, chipset o dispositivos integrados." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is initialising the southbridge, chipset or onboard devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está leyendo la información de los módulos de memoria para conocer sus parámetros básicos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is reading the memory modules' information to learn their basic parameters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está programando los timings de la memoria detectada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is programming the timings of the detected memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa está realizando comprobaciones OEM previas a la inicialización completa de la memoria." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard is running OEM checks before fully initialising the memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa ha detectado una unidad, pero encuentra un problema al inicializarla o acceder a ella." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard has detected a drive but hits a problem initialising or accessing it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa ha iniciado un proceso automático o forzado de recuperación de BIOS/firmware." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard has started an automatic or forced BIOS/firmware recovery process."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no consigue completar la detección inicial de los módulos RAM." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't finish the initial detection of the RAM modules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no detecta un módulo de RAM funcional." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't find a working RAM module."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no detecta una GPU o una salida gráfica válida." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't find a GPU or a valid graphics output."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no puede completar una rutina interna de reinicio o inicialización de firmware." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't finish an internal firmware reset or initialisation routine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no puede detectar la memoria instalada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't detect the installed memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no puede inicializar la memoria. Un módulo puede estar mal encajado, en una ranura no recomendada o no ser compatible con la configuración actual." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't initialise the memory. A module may be badly seated, in a non-recommended slot or incompatible with the current configuration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no puede iniciar el procesador instalado con la versión actual de BIOS o configuración." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't start the installed processor with the current BIOS version or configuration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no puede iniciar el procesador o ha detectado un problema crítico de CPU, socket o alimentación." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard can't start the processor or has found a critical CPU, socket or power problem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa no reconoce la tarjeta gráfica o la gráfica integrada." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard doesn't recognise the graphics card or the integrated graphics."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La placa suele encender estos indicadores durante unos segundos. El importante es el que se queda fijo y detiene el arranque." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The motherboard usually lights these indicators for a few seconds. The important one is the one that stays lit and stops the boot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La plataforma usa %@, igual que la RAM elegida." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The platform uses %@, the same as the chosen RAM."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La primera zona de la RAM no responde. Suele ser un módulo mal colocado o defectuoso." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first area of RAM isn't responding. It's usually a badly seated or faulty module."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La RAM no se detecta o no puede inicializarse con la configuración actual." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The RAM isn't detected or can't be initialised with the current configuration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La RAM o la placa base no superan la prueba." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The RAM or motherboard fails the test."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La ranura no se instala: se usa para montar una tarjeta de expansión. Abra su pestaña de bloqueo, alinee la GPU con la ranura y los huecos traseros de la caja, presione hasta que cierre el seguro y atornille la tarjeta al chasis. Conecte después la alimentación de la GPU si la requiere." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The slot isn't installed: it's used to fit an expansion card. Open its locking tab, line up the GPU with the slot and the case's rear openings, press until the latch closes and screw the card to the chassis. Then connect the GPU power if it needs it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La ranura no se instala: se utiliza para colocar RAM. Abra los seguros laterales, alinee la muesca del módulo con la guía de la ranura y presione de forma uniforme hasta que los seguros encajen. Para dos módulos, consulte el manual; normalmente se usan A2 y B2." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The slot isn't installed: it's used to fit RAM. Open the side latches, line up the module's notch with the slot key and press evenly until the latches click. For two modules, check the manual; A2 and B2 are usually used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La ranura no se instala: se utiliza para montar un SSD M.2 compatible. Retire el disipador si existe, ajuste el separador a la longitud de la unidad —habitualmente 2280—, inserte el SSD en ángulo y bájelo sin forzarlo. Fíjelo con el tornillo o cierre y vuelva a colocar el disipador tras retirar el plástico del pad térmico." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The slot isn't installed: it's used to fit a compatible M.2 SSD. Remove the heatsink if there is one, set the standoff to the drive length —usually 2280—, insert the SSD at an angle and lower it without forcing it. Secure it with the screw or latch and refit the heatsink after removing the plastic film from the thermal pad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La ranura no se instala: se utiliza para montar una tarjeta de expansión compatible. Retire la cubierta trasera necesaria de la caja, inserte la tarjeta recta, fíjela con un tornillo al chasis e instale los controladores del fabricante si el sistema operativo no la reconoce." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The slot isn't installed: it's used to fit a compatible expansion card. Remove the necessary rear cover from the case, insert the card straight, screw it to the chassis and install the manufacturer's drivers if the operating system doesn't recognise it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La secuencia de comprobación ha terminado. En algunas placas MSI, el display pasa después a mostrar la temperatura de CPU." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The check sequence has finished. On some MSI motherboards, the display then switches to showing the CPU temperature."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La tarjeta gráfica o su memoria no responden." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The graphics card or its memory isn't responding."
          }
        }
      }
