            "value" : "The gold contacts that go into the motherboard's PCIe x16 slot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los escaneos más antiguos que el periodo seleccionado se eliminarán automáticamente al abrir el historial." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scans older than the selected period will be deleted automatically when you open the history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los módulos DDR4 y DDR5 no pueden usarse juntos." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DDR4 and DDR5 modules can't be used together."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los nombres y colores corresponden al estándar de hardware. Comprueba la serigrafía impresa junto a los LEDs de tu placa." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Names and colours follow the hardware standard. Check the labels printed next to the LEDs on your motherboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los separadores o standoffs son piezas metálicas que elevan la placa base y evitan que sus soldaduras contacten directamente con el chasis." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standoffs are metal pieces that raise the motherboard and stop its solder points touching the chassis directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
