    "Ojo: si conectas el segundo NVMe en la ranura M2_2, tu puerto SATA_1 quedará desactivado o tu tarjeta gráfica bajará de x16 a x8." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heads up: if you connect the second NVMe drive to the M2_2 slot, your SATA_1 port will be disabled or your graphics card will drop from x16 to x8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
