    "Procesador" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Processor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Procesador AMD Ryzen. Gestiona el procesamiento general del PC, la memoria y líneas PCIe para gráficos y almacenamiento." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AMD Ryzen processor. It handles the PC's general processing, the memory and the PCIe lanes for graphics and storage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Procesador Intel Core. Ejecuta instrucciones, coordina tareas del sistema y contiene núcleos, caché y controlador de memoria integrado." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intel Core processor. It runs instructions, coordinates system tasks and contains the cores, cache and integrated memory controller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Procesador o CPU. Es el chip que ejecuta las instrucciones de los programas y coordina el resto de componentes. Se monta en el socket de la placa base, que debe ser del mismo fabricante (Intel o AMD) y generación." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Processor or CPU. It's the chip that runs program instructions and coordinates the other components. It goes in the motherboard socket, which must be from the same manufacturer (Intel or AMD) and generation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Procesador y placa compatibles" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CPU and motherboard compatible"
          }
        }
      }
