            "value" : "HDMI port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puerto SATA" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SATA port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puerto SATA de datos integrado en la placa base. Se utiliza para conectar SSD SATA, discos duros y algunas unidades ópticas." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SATA data port built into the motherboard. It's used to connect SATA SSDs, hard drives and some optical drives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puerto USB A" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USB-A port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puerto USB C" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USB-C port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puerto USB de tipo A, rectangular. Está en el panel trasero de la placa base y en el frontal de la caja. Sirve para teclado, ratón, memorias y otros periféricos. Si su interior es azul o rojo suele ser USB 3.x (más rápido)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rectangular USB Type-A port. It's on the motherboard's rear panel and on the front of the case. It's used for keyboards, mice, flash drives and other peripherals. If it's blue or red inside, it's usually USB 3.x (faster)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
