    "SSD M.2" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "M.2 SSD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSD M.2 con interfaz SATA. Tiene forma parecida a un NVMe, pero utiliza protocolo SATA y necesita una ranura que admita expresamente SATA." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "M.2 SSD with a SATA interface. It looks like an NVMe drive, but it uses the SATA protocol and needs a slot that explicitly supports SATA."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSD NVMe en formato M.2. Usa líneas PCIe y ofrece baja latencia y altas velocidades de transferencia; es habitual para el sistema operativo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NVMe SSD in M.2 form factor. It uses PCIe lanes and offers low latency and high transfer speeds; it's commonly used for the operating system."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SSD SATA" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SATA SSD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subir" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Move up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele aparecer en una pequeña pantalla de dos dígitos de la placa base, cerca de la zona inferior o del borde derecho." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It usually appears on a small two-digit display on the motherboard, near the bottom or the right edge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele estar integrada en el bloque de la CPU o en el radiador. Conecte su cable de alimentación al cabezal AIO_PUMP o W_PUMP de la placa base." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's usually built into the CPU block or the radiator. Connect its power cable to the motherboard's AIO_PUMP or W_PUMP header."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele estar relacionado con compatibilidad legacy y dispositivos de expansión." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's usually related to legacy compatibility and expansion devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele indicar un problema de unidad, sistema operativo o configuración de boot." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It usually points to a drive, operating system or boot configuration problem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele requerir consultar el manual del modelo y la versión de BIOS." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It usually requires checking your model's manual and BIOS version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele ser informativo, no un error." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's usually informational, not an error."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele ser un código de progreso." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's usually a progress code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele ser un estado informativo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's usually an informational state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suele ser un estado normal si el PC arranca." : {
