    "VRM" : {

    },
    "Ya tiene %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Already has %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ya tienes los componentes principales del equipo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You already have the PC's main components."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zócalo de la placa base donde va el procesador. Intel usa sockets LGA, con los contactos en la placa; AMD usa AM4, con pines en la CPU, o AM5, con contactos en la placa. Una CPU solo encaja en el socket de su misma familia." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Motherboard socket where the processor goes. Intel uses LGA sockets, with the contacts on the motherboard; AMD uses AM4, with pins on the CPU, or AM5, with contacts on the motherboard. A CPU only fits the socket of its own family."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zócalo integrado en la placa base para procesadores AMD compatibles. AM4 usa pines en el procesador, mientras que AM5 tiene contactos en la placa base." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Socket built into the motherboard for compatible AMD processors. AM4 uses pins on the CPU, while AM5 has the contacts on the motherboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zócalo LGA integrado en la placa base para procesadores Intel compatibles. En estos sockets, los contactos delicados están en la placa y el procesador tiene superficies de contacto planas." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LGA socket built into the motherboard for compatible Intel processors. In these sockets the delicate contacts are on the motherboard and the CPU has flat contact pads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ZONA APROXIMADA" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APPROXIMATE AREA"
          }
        }
      }
    }
